      trivia: "【Numbers as Ciphers】The founding '88' refers to 1988, the year Giolito returned to Nevada. Vitola names such as 88, f9, cg:4 and mj12 are given as ciphers alluding to the Illuminati and to UFO conspiracy lore (Majestic 12). The bands are woven with symbological imagery such as the Eye of Providence and the scarab, and the trademark carries the line 'WE ARE NOT INDUSTRY STANDARD'. For all his talk of conspiracies, Giolito's true obsession has always been quality."
